# Public keys allowed to sign update-manifest.txt, in ssh allowed_signers format:
#
#   release ssh-ed25519 AAAA... comment
#
# Generate a pair with:
#   ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -N '' -C browser-print-agentd-release -f release-signing-key
# then paste release-signing-key.pub here prefixed with the identity "release",
# and store the PRIVATE key as the RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY GitHub Actions secret.
#
# While this file holds no key line, build-pkg.sh ships no updater at all: the
# package installs an agent that never checks for updates.
